    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Weight 52.8 kg, up 0.5 kg in a week; energy a little better</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in vision with reading glasses</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Sore throat gone; chewing still uncomfortable with the old denture</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations, or ankle swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>Cough gone; no breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Appetite improving; no nausea, bleeding, or change in bowel habit</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No urinary symptoms or postmenopausal bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Occasional right shoulder ache; no joint swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No new skin lesions; no bruising</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No dizziness or unsteadiness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mood improving; PHQ-9 11; no thoughts of death or self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>11 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
