    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with her consent, held privately. She has named a woman of her household who has served her for decades as her health care agent and will sign the written directive at her next visit. She wants treatment for any illness she might recover from, including hospital care. If she were dying, she would want to be kept comfortable in her own rooms, with prayers and music, rather than resuscitation or a breathing machine. She asked that her directive and any news of her health be shared with no one beyond her agent and her care team. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>
